@startuml system-context
title System context: monitoring growth and development of children aged 0-5

skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #4A5563
}
skinparam rectangle<<planned>> {
  BackgroundColor #F1F3F5
  BorderColor #8A939E
  BorderStyle dashed
  FontColor #4A5563
}
skinparam rectangle<<external>> {
  BackgroundColor #FFF6E5
  BorderColor #B7791F
}
skinparam rectangle<<reference>> {
  BackgroundColor #EEF6EE
  BorderColor #3F7F4F
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #2F3B4A
}

actor "Parent\n(owner of the child's record)" as Parent
actor "Specialist\n(pediatric specialist, speech therapist,\npsychologist, kindergarten teacher)" as Specialist
actor "Operator" as Operator

rectangle "Polyclinic\n(preventive examinations:\nweight, height, head circumference)" as Clinic <<external>>

rectangle "Child Development Monitor\n\nprofiles and access | growth vs WHO |\nmilestones vs CDC / WHO | signals |\nhistory | reminders" as System #E8EEF4

rectangle "WHO Child Growth Standards\n(LMS tables 0-60 months from the\nWHO anthro package; windows for\n6 motor milestones)" as WHO <<reference>>
rectangle "CDC milestone checklists\n(2022 revision, 12 checklists,\n2 months to 5 years)" as CDC <<reference>>
rectangle "Kazakhstan MoH rules\n(examination ages, Order\nKR DSM-264/2020)" as KZ <<reference>>

rectangle "In-app notifications\n(ADR-007; e-mail and push later)" as Notify
rectangle "Prometheus" as Prometheus <<external>>
rectangle "Grafana" as Grafana <<external>>

Clinic ..> Parent : measured values\n(no system integration)
Parent --> System : child profile, measurements,\nmilestone answers, access grants
Specialist --> System : granted children only:\nobservations, notes
System --> Parent : charts, progress,\nsignals, reminders
System --> Specialist : charts, history, signals
WHO ..> System : embedded as versioned\nreference data (WHO-2006)
CDC ..> System : embedded as versioned\nreference data (CDC-2022)
KZ ..> System : examination ages\nfor reminders
System --> Notify : reminders, new signals,\nnew notes
Prometheus --> System : scrape /metrics
Grafana --> Prometheus : PromQL
Operator --> Grafana

note bottom of System
  Signals suggest a conversation with a specialist;
  the system never produces a diagnosis.
  Evaluation uses synthetic data only.
end note
@enduml
